Undercurrent Foundation contains selected mechanisms derived from Intessio
Foundation (https://github.com/aixand/intessio), distributed under Apache-2.0.
See the repository LICENSE for the license text.

Source locations at extraction:
- foundation/intessio-foundation/crates/core/src/bounded.rs
- foundation/intessio-foundation/crates/core/src/digest.rs
- foundation/intessio-foundation/crates/core/src/canonical.rs
- foundation/intessio-foundation/crates/core/src/reference.rs
- foundation/intessio-foundation/crates/privacy/src/lib.rs

Extraction retains digest encoding and constant-time verification, canonical
JSON output and limits, opaque URI validation, classification serialization,
and the default sensitive-material detection policy. Intessio-specific APIs,
reference types, generic wire decoders, redaction and secret-resolution APIs
are intentionally outside this crate. Relevant tests are retained or adapted
to the extracted API.
